## 1. Project Context

This project helps [YOUR NAME] improve their CV, LinkedIn profile, and job application materials for [TARGET LEVEL] roles.

### Target Roles
1. **[Role 1]** - Key focus areas, skills needed
2. **[Role 2]** - Key focus areas, skills needed
3. **[Role 3]** - Key focus areas, skills needed

### Project Goals
- Analyze work history from multiple sources (git, CV, LinkedIn, blog)
- Build comprehensive skills inventory and achievements database
- Generate role-specific CV versions
- Produce LinkedIn optimization recommendations

