## 4. Critical Context for CV Writing

### MUST USE - Verified High-Impact Facts

**Executive Communication:**
- [Key executive interactions]
- [Notable clients you can name]
- [High-value deals influenced]

**Awards & Recognition:**
- [Award 1] ([Year])
- [Award 2] ([Year])
- [Nominations]

**Scale Metrics:**
- [Users/customers served]
- [Platform scale achieved]
- [Geographic reach]

**Team Metrics:**
- [Team size managed]
- [Direct reports]
- [People hired personally]
- [People mentored/promoted]

**Technical Metrics:**
- [Key technical achievements]
- [Performance improvements]
- [Cost savings]

**Cost/Business Metrics:**
- [Budget responsibility]
- [Cost reductions achieved]
- [Revenue influenced]

