## 10. CV PDF Generation Status

**Status:** [Current state]

### Current Page Counts
| CV Version | Pages | Target | Status |
|------------|-------|--------|--------|
| [Role 1] | X | 2 | [Status] |
| [Role 2] | X | 2 | [Status] |
| [Role 3] | X | 2 | [Status] |

### PDF Generation Tool
Script: `scripts/make-cv.js`
```bash
# Generate HTML only
node scripts/make-cv.js outputs/cv-versions/[role].md

# Generate HTML + PDF with page count
node scripts/make-cv.js outputs/cv-versions/[role].md --pdf
```

Dependencies: `playwright`, `pdf-lib` (run `npm install` first)

### Bold Highlighting Guidelines
Add bold to draw attention to:
- Company names that carry weight
- Key metrics (percentages, dollar amounts, user counts)
- Awards and recognition
- Scale numbers (team size, users, etc.)
- Time periods that show longevity

